2. **`agent-done-or-not` (proof-of-done gate)**: a Stop-hook that blocks the agent from ending its turn unless the most recent receipt is passing, fresh (epoch inside the receipt, not mtime — mtime can be forged by `touch`), not already used, and policy-satisfying. Labels are **RE-EXECUTED / ASSERTED / UNPARSED — never "VERIFIED"**. It compares the receipt's recorded commit/tree/dirty state to current — "the classic green receipt from before your last edit". Fails closed.

